# SharePanel Affiliated

**sharepanel.host (main site):** The official SharePanel hosting portal offers developer-friendly web hosting (e.g. instant GitHub deployments, “Simple No Code Services” or SNCS) and emphasizes community governance ([SharePanel - Simplify Your Hosting](https://sharepanel.host/#:~:text=SharePanel%20was%20born%20from%20the,platform%20made%20with%20actual%20love)) ([SharePanel - Simplify Your Hosting](https://sharepanel.host/#:~:text=%2F%2F%20Deploy%20in%20a%20single,deploy%28config)).  It provides user sign-up and login (via `/signup.php` and `/login.php`), and an admin dashboard (`/admin-login.php`) for organization management ([SharePanel Forums](https://threads.sharepanel.host/#:~:text=,a%20user%20to%20my%20org)).  Notably, it includes a **Stock Market** page at `/stock/` (“SharePanel Stock”) where users can trade shares and vote on proposals ([Stock Market - SharePanel](https://sharepanel.host/stock/#:~:text=Welcome%20to%20SharePanel%20Stock)), and a **Currency Trading Simulator** at `/dev/PaperStock/` (the “Stock Investor” project) letting users trade virtual currency portfolios ([
    Currency Trading Simulator  ](https://sharepanel.host/dev/PaperStock/#:~:text=Currency%20Trading%20Simulator)).  The main site also hosts a blog (`/blog/`) for announcements (e.g. explaining SNCS instances) ([SharePanel Blog](https://sharepanel.host/blog/#:~:text=Image%3A%20Author%20sahwe%20Apr%2030%2C,2025)) and a multi-step registration workflow (organization info, admin setup, email verification) as seen in its signup pages.  Historically, SharePanel began on a free 000webhostapp subdomain (`shareps.000webhostapp.com`) before moving to sharepanel.host ([SharePanel. This has been a bit of a wild ride -and… | by Share Panel | Medium](https://medium.com/@sharepanel/sharepanel-bc3dd5cf4cca#:~:text=https%3A%2F%2Fshareps)).

- **sharepanel.host/stock – SharePanel Stock Market:**  A built-in trading platform (“Stock Investor”) for managing portfolios and voting on governance; e.g. “Trade shares, exchange orders, vote on proposals” ([Stock Market - SharePanel](https://sharepanel.host/stock/#:~:text=Welcome%20to%20SharePanel%20Stock)).  
- **sharepanel.host/dev/PaperStock – Currency Trading Simulator:**  A development version of the trading app, simulating currency exchange with \$100,000 CAD starting capital ([
    Currency Trading Simulator  ](https://sharepanel.host/dev/PaperStock/#:~:text=Currency%20Trading%20Simulator)).  
- **sharepanel.host/blog – SharePanel Blog:** Hosts articles about the platform (e.g. “What are SharePanel’s SNCS Instances?”) ([SharePanel Blog](https://sharepanel.host/blog/#:~:text=What%20are%20SharePanel%27s%20SNCS%20Instances%3F)).  
- **sharepanel.host/app/demo.html – Demos Page:** A video demo page for SharePanel features.  
- **sharepanel.host/admin-login.php – Admin Login:** Multi-step login for organization administrators ([SharePanel Forums](https://threads.sharepanel.host/#:~:text=,a%20user%20to%20my%20org)).  
- **sharepanel.host/reg.html (or /signup.php) – Registration:** User sign-up forms (the forum notes a “Create your free account” link at `/reg.html`) ([SharePanel Forums](https://forum.sharepanel.host/?home#:~:text=The%20final%20significant%20limitation%2C%20is,host%20backend%20%2F%20dynamic%20systems)).  

**Subdomains and Services:** Beyond the main domain, SharePanel runs several distinct sub-sites on `*.sharepanel.host`, each serving a specific function:

- **threads.sharepanel.host – SharePanel Forums (Feedback Channel):** A community discussion forum (called “SharePanel Threads”) for user feedback and general topics. It features categories like “SharePanel Host – Feedback” and trending threads (e.g. “SP/Daily Life”). The header is simply “SharePanel Forums” and it invites users to post feedback about the service ([SharePanel Forums](https://threads.sharepanel.host/#:~:text=SharePanel%20Forums)).  
- **forum.sharepanel.host – SharePanel Threads (About Page):** Another entry point to the forums, this page describes the forum’s purpose: “an interactive and versatile forum” where users connect, share tips, and even trade resources in a community marketplace ([SharePanel Forums](https://forum.sharepanel.host/#:~:text=What%20Is%20This%3F)) ([SharePanel Forums](https://forum.sharepanel.host/#:~:text=In%20addition%20to%20discussion%20threads%2C,the%20most%20out%20of%20SharePanel)).  
- **docs.sharepanel.host – Documentation Viewer:** A Markdown-based documentation platform. Users can upload markdown files to directories and browse them as docs (as noted in the forum “Cool Websites” thread) ([SharePanel Forums](https://forum.sharepanel.host/?community=2#:~:text=,and%20Websites)).  The page UI (“Markdown Document Viewer”) has a sidebar and dark mode toggle.  
- **droplet.sharepanel.host – Droplet (File Sharing Service):** A simple file upload/sharing microservice. It allows uploading files or folders (protected by a password) and shows recent uploads. (Forum posts call it a “Simple File Sharing” tool) ([SharePanel Forums](https://forum.sharepanel.host/?community=2#:~:text=%23%20Droplet%20,Sharing)).  
- **market.sharepanel.host – Software Marketplace:** A site for buying/selling software. It requires login. As described on the forum, it’s a publicly available marketplace for scripts and tools (e.g. users “can purchase and sell your own software” at this URL) ([SharePanel Forums](https://forum.sharepanel.host/?post=3#:~:text=)).  
- **x.sharepanel.host – X (Casual Web Games):** A lightweight gaming portal. According to the founder’s profile, “X” is “a simple HTML gaming site offering a variety of casual games” built with HTML/JavaScript ([Sahwe / Smoke-wolf/ JDX50S](https://sharepanel.host/me/#:~:text=Casual%20Web%20Games)). (Forum posts mention it as “sharepanel.host/x” when discussing a redirect service – likely the same site.)  
- **mta.sharepanel.host – Mount Allison Social:** A student-run social network for Mount Allison University students. It’s an unofficial platform (only @mta.ca emails can register) for building communities and sharing posts ([Mount Allison Social](https://mta.sharepanel.host/#:~:text=,and%20ensuring%20you%20have%20a)) ([Mount Allison Social](https://mta.sharepanel.host/#:~:text=,If%20any%20issues%20arise)). The homepage “Mount Allison Social” explains it is student-developed, free of university oversight, and governance is done by its users ([Mount Allison Social](https://mta.sharepanel.host/#:~:text=,and%20ensuring%20you%20have%20a)).  

**Additional Embedded Platforms:** Within these sites, SharePanel has integrated or linked other tools:
  - The **Stock Market** at `/stock/` is embedded into the main site (see above).  
  - The **Documentation Viewer** and **Marketplace** (under docs.sharepanel.host and market.sharepanel.host) provide centralized hosting of resources and apps for SharePanel users ([SharePanel Forums](https://forum.sharepanel.host/?community=2#:~:text=,and%20Websites)).  
  - Community resources are linked across the forum and main site (e.g. posts linking to `/dev/PaperStock` or `/app/demo.html`).  

